        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>16 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Glass Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\n16\" with 12\" mounting centers ladder style glass door handles made of high grade 304 stainless steel. For use on residential and commercial glass doors, <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO158-pull-size.gif?v=1704354618\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"16 Inch Contemporary Glass Door Pulls\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Clean contemporary design with the perfect sized 1-1/4\" round grip handle that is very comfortable to grab. Packaged with glass door mounting kit.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for DWD-DJO158-SD Glass Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel </b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on <b>1/4\" to 5/8\" thick glass doors</b> with a <b>5/8\" diameter hole in glass</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pull Handles)</b>\r\n</p>",
